                                <h1>Latest scams, fraud &amp; security alerts
</h1>
                            
                            
                            
                        
                        

                        <div>
                            <p>Stay up to date with some of the latest scams and security alerts affecting Australians and CommBank customers. Learn how these scams work, warning signs to look out for, and what you can do if you&#39;re targeted.</p>
<p>Think you&#39;ve been scammed? Call straight away or message us in the CommBank app.</p>

                        </div>
                        


                        


                        
                        <div class="cta">
                            <p>
                                
