    <div class="group-module">
    
        <div id="help">
            <div class="group">




    
    
    <div class="column-control">
    
        <div class="column-container bottom-divider">
            <div class="column-items standard-spacing   ">
                <div class="one-by-three-columns">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2>How to report a scam
</h2>
                            
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        <div class="row one-column one-by-three-columns">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item    ">
                
                <div class="item-inner">
                    <div>
                        <div>If you think you’ve been scammed, follow these steps:​</div>
<div> </div>
<ol><li>Stop all communications with the suspected scammer​</li><li><a href="https://www.commbank.com.au/support.digital-banking.change-netbank-password.html" data-tracker-locationid="link_change-netbank-password" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;link_change-netbank-password&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Change your password in NetBank</a> or <a href="http://www.commbank.com.au/support.business.commbiz.reset-password.html" data-tracker-locationid="link_general-security" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;link_general-security&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">CommBiz</a> and <a href="http://www.commbank.com.au/support.cards.change-card-pin.html" data-tracker-locationid="link_change-card-pin" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;link_change-card-pin&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">change your card PIN</a>​</li><li><a href="/digital-banking/lock-block-limit-your-credit-card.html" data-tracker-locationid="link_lock-block-limit-your-credit-card" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;link_lock-block-limit-your-credit-card&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Lock your card</a> ​and check your digital wallets. Go to card settings in the CommBank app to check and deregister any devices in the list that you don’t recognise</li><li><a href="https://mobile-app-redirect.commbank.com.au/support/messaging?jumpId&#61;jump_selfserviceservicewebsitecommbank_helpwithhoaxorscam&amp;entryPoint&#61;websitecommbank" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">Message us in the CommBank app</a> 24/7 or call us on <a href="tel:132221" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">13 2221</a>, or if you&#39;re a business customer, <a data-tracker-locationid="report_call-121998" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;report_call-121998&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="tel:131998">call 13 1998</a> and select option 4.</li></ol>

                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    


    
</div>


    
    
    <div class="column-control">
    
        <div class="column-container bottom-divider" id="protect">
            <div class="column-items standard-spacing   remove-bottom-padding">
                <div class="header-one-column">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2>Received an unexpected call or message from us?
</h2>
                            
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        <div class="row one-column ">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="key-points">
	
		<div class="key-points-module">
			<div class="article-key-points">
				<h2>We&#39;ll never ask you to</h2>
<p>✘ Share your NetBank Client ID, NetCode or passwords</p>
<p>✘ Share your card details including your PIN, expiry date or CVC</p>
<p>✘ Withdraw cash, transfer money or buy gift cards</p>
<p>✘ Login directly to your account via a link from an email or SMS</p>
<p>✘ Move money to a “safe” account</p>
<p>✘ Help us catch cyber criminals</p>
<p>✘ Share your screen or download remote access software</p>
<p> </p>
<p><b>What to do:</b></p>
<ul><li>Ask the caller to verify it&#39;s us by sending a <a href="/support/security/callercheck.html" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">CallerCheck</a> security code to your CommBank app. </li><li>Hang up and then contact us directly. </li><li>Even if a message looks real, always use official details on our website or in the CommBank app. </li><li><a href="/support/messaging.html">Message us</a> in the CommBank app or by calling <a href="tel:132221">13 2221</a> or if you are a business customer, call <a data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;" href="tel:%20131998">13 1998</a> and select option 4.</li></ul>
<p>If you received a suspicious message and haven’t clicked on it, you can report it by sending a screenshot or copy to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#066e69677e202530323d6564672865696b286773" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">hoax&#64;cba.com.au</a></p>

			</div>
		</div>
	


    
</div>


</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    


    
</div>


    
    
    <div class="column-control">
    
        <div class="column-container bottom-divider">
            <div class="column-items standard-spacing   ">
                <div class="one-by-three-columns">
                    <div class="header-section">
                        <div class="header-content">
                            <h2>Spotted someone impersonating CommBank?
</h2>
                            
                            
                            
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="container content-container">
                        <div class="row one-column one-by-three-columns">
                            <div class="col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg">




    
    
    <div class="content-module">
    <div>

        
            <div class="item    ">
                
                <div class="item-inner">
                    <div>
                        <p>By reporting suspicious messages, you help protect CommBank customers and the wider Australian community.</p>
<p>If you receive a suspicious email or SMS but didn’t click any links, email a screenshot or copy to <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#91f9fef0e9b7b2a7a5aaf2f3f0bff2fefcbff0e4" data-tracker-type="richtext" dtmtracker="&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;&#64;">hoax&#64;cba.com.au</a></p>
<p>Forward it to us including any attachments then report it as spam, block the sender and delete it.</p>

                    </div>
                    
                    
                    
                    
                    
                </div>
            </div>
            
        
    </div>


    
</div>


</div>
                        </div>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                    </div>
                </div>
                
            </div>
        </div>
    


    
</div>


</div>
            
        </div>
    
</div>


</div>
        
    </div>

